          <caption>
            <p>Tibial Diaphyseal&#x000a0;Fracture on Radiography.&#x000a0;This anteroposterior radiograph shows a displaced transverse fracture of the left tibial diaphysis with cortical disruption. The fibula is intact and does not show evidence of fracture. Image courtesy S Bhimji MD</p>
